# Third-party notices

This directory holds a vendored basemap style, its fonts and sprites. A small
extract of OpenFreeMap vector tiles lives at `dev/tiles/canmore.pmtiles`. The
following components and licences apply.

## Attribution

Map data © [OpenStreetMap contributors](https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright),
available under the [Open Database Licence](https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/).

Vector tiles are provided by [OpenFreeMap](https://openfreemap.org). The style is
© [OpenMapTiles](https://openmaptiles.org/); the cartography and visual design are
licensed under [CC BY 4.0](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).

Keep the attribution visible when using this basemap. The style’s `attribution`
source carries the attribution string used by the map renderer.

